:: RobinTemple Penance Hearing
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Jordan takes you to the side of the hall. "The examination cannot tell me who chose to break a vow," Jordan says. "I will listen to you both before deciding what follows."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    约旦带你们来到大厅侧边。“检查分辨不出是谁选择违背誓言，”约旦说，“决定后续处置前，我会听你们两个人讲清楚。”
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $RobinTemple.breach is 'pc'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin steps forward. "It was not my choice," <<he>> says. <<He>> still does not let go of your hand.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾向前一步。“那不是我的选择，”<<he>>说，却仍没有松开你的手。
  <</language>>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.breach is 'robin'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin lowers <<his>> eyes. "I broke mine," <<he>> says before you can speak for <<him>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾垂下眼。“是我违背了自己的誓言，”<<he>>抢在你替<<him>>开口前说。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You each admit what happened. Jordan does not let either of you take responsibility for the other’s choice.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们各自承认发生的事。约旦不许任何一方替另一方承担自己的选择。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '如实说明经过' 'RobinTemple Penance Honest'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '请求和罗宾一起赎罪' 'RobinTemple Penance Together'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Penance Honest
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.penance_day gte 0 and !$RobinTemple.penance_hearing_done and !$RobinTemple.penance_trial_done>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.penance_hearing_done to true>>
	  <<language>>
	    <<option 'EN'>>
	      You explain what happened without asking Robin to carry your part. The words feel hotter than the act did now that they are spoken in the temple hall. Jordan writes them down without flinching, then turns to Robin for <<his>> own account.
	    <<option 'CN'>>
	      你说清经过，没有让罗宾替你承担那一部分。那些话在神殿大厅里说出口时，比当时发生的一切还要烫。约旦没有移开视线，只把它们记下，转向罗宾，等<<he>>自己讲述。
	  <</language>>
	  <br><br>
	  <<if $RobinTemple.breach is 'pc'>>
	    <<language>>
	      <<option 'EN'>>
	        Robin listens with <<his>> jaw tight. When you admit how your body answered someone else, <<he>> looks hurt, but not surprised. <<He>> still reaches for your sleeve before Jordan speaks again.
	      <<option 'CN'>>
	        罗宾咬紧牙听着。你承认自己的身体怎样回应了别人时，<<he>>看起来受了伤，却并不惊讶。约旦再次开口前，<<he>>仍伸手抓住了你的袖口。
	    <</language>>
	  <<elseif $RobinTemple.breach is 'robin'>>
	    <<language>>
	      <<option 'EN'>>
	        Robin's voice shakes when <<he>> describes <<his>> own wanting. <<He>> does not hide behind fear or confusion; <<he>> names the desire, the choice, and the way <<his>> body betrayed the vow before <<his>> mouth could.
	      <<option 'CN'>>
	        罗宾说起自己的欲望时，声音在发抖。<<He>>没有躲在恐惧或混乱后面，而是把那份想要、那个选择，以及身体比嘴唇更早背叛誓言的瞬间，一样样说出来。
	    <</language>>
	  <<else>>
	    <<language>>
	      <<option 'EN'>>
	        Neither of you is allowed to turn confession into protection. Jordan makes you separate the shared heat from the separate choices, until every admission has a name attached to it.
	      <<option 'CN'>>
	        约旦不许你们把坦白变成相互遮掩。约旦让你们把共同的热意与各自的选择分开，直到每一句承认都清清楚楚落在该负责的人身上。
	    <</language>>
	  <</if>>
	  <br><br>
	  <<language>>
	    <<option 'EN'>>
	      "Work beside each other if you wish," Jordan says, "but each of you must answer for your own vow."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “你们愿意，可以并肩做事，”约旦说，“但每个人都必须为自己的誓言负责。”
  <</language>>
  <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 2)>>
  <<npcincr Robin dom 1>><br><br><<gdom>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan has already heard your account for this examination.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦已经听过你对这次检查的说明。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<robin-temple-penance-exit>>

:: RobinTemple Penance Trial
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Two attendants take you to the cloister. Jordan remains at the door. "You will clean the room where the initiates prepare for vigil," Jordan says. "Then each of you will tell me, separately, how you will answer for your vow."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    两名侍从带你们来到回廊。约旦停在门口。“先把见习教徒准备守夜的房间打扫干净，”约旦说，“之后各自告诉我，打算怎样为自己的誓言负责。”
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The floor is cold beneath your knees. Robin works beside you, tired but intent on finishing <<his>> section rather than leaving it to you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    地板透过膝盖传来寒意。罗宾在你身边做事，虽然疲倦，仍坚持完成<<his>>的那一部分。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '伸手扶住罗宾' 'RobinTemple Penance Trial Result'>><<set $RobinTemple.penance_response to 'hold'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>
<<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '请求约旦听你们解释' 'RobinTemple Penance Trial Result'>><<set $RobinTemple.penance_response to 'speak'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>
<<choreicon 'sweep'>><<lanLink '先把手里的工作做完' 'RobinTemple Penance Trial Result'>><<set $RobinTemple.penance_response to 'endure'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Penance Trial Result
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.penance_day gte 0 and !$RobinTemple.penance_trial_done
  and ['hold', 'speak', 'endure'].includes($RobinTemple.penance_response)>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.penance_trial_done to true>>
  <<switch $RobinTemple.penance_response>>
    <<case 'hold'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You steady Robin when <<he>> stumbles. <<He>> accepts your arm, then straightens and goes back to the task. Jordan watches without interrupting.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾踉跄时，你扶住了<<him>>。<<He>>借着你的手臂站稳，又回去做事。约旦没有打断。
      <</language>>
      <<npcincr Robin love 2>><<stress 3>><br><br><<glove>><<gstress>>
    <<case 'speak'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You ask Jordan to hear both of you. Jordan asks you to finish the room first. When you do, Jordan returns and gives each of you time to speak.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你请求约旦听你们说明。约旦请你们先把屋子打扫完。等工作结束，约旦回来，给你们各自发言的时间。
      <</language>>
      <<if currentSkillValue('willpower') gte 400>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin describes <<his>> own choice clearly. Jordan tells <<him>> that being honest about it matters.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾把自己的选择讲得清楚。约旦说，愿意如实面对这件事，很重要。
        <</language>>
        <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 4)>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin struggles to find the words. Jordan lets <<him>> pause and begin again.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾一时找不到合适的话。约旦让<<he>>停一停，再重新说。
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <<npcincr Robin dom 1>><br><br><<gdom>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You finish your part without looking up. Robin does the same. When the last bucket is emptied, <<he>> asks whether you can talk on the way out.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你低头做完了自己的活。罗宾也是。最后一桶水倒掉后，<<he>>问能不能在出去的路上聊聊。
      <</language>>
      <<grace 1>><<stress 4>><br><br><<ggrace>><<gstress>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan records the first day of your work. "The rest cannot be done in one night," Jordan says.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦记下你们完成的第一天工作。“剩下的事，不能一夜做完。”约旦说。
  <</language>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.penance_work_day isnot Time.days>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.penance_service += 1>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.penance_work_day to Time.days>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan has already recorded this work. The remaining shifts are on your list.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦已经记下这次工作。其余班次仍按清单安排。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<if $RobinTemple.breach is 'robin'>>
  <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<getinicon>><<lanLink '接受自己的净化' 'Temple Arcade Intro'>><<endevent>><<clotheson>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Penance Together
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.penance_day gte 0 and !$RobinTemple.penance_hearing_done and !$RobinTemple.penance_trial_done>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.penance_hearing_done to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask to stay with Robin through the work ahead. Robin nods, but Jordan raises a hand. "Support is welcome. Do not make Robin’s answer for <<him>>."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你请求在接下来的工作中陪着罗宾。罗宾点头，约旦却抬起一只手。“陪伴可以，但不要替<<him>>作答。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin turns to you. "I want you there," <<he>> says. "I also want to do my own share."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾转向你。“我希望你在，”<<he>>说，“也想把自己那份做好。”
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan has already heard your account for this examination.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦已经听过你对这次检查的说明。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<robin-temple-penance-exit>>

:: RobinTemple Penance Work
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.penance_day gte 0 and $RobinTemple.penance_work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.penance_work_day to Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.penance_service += 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin checks the beds while you sort clean linen. A younger initiate offers to take one pile. Robin thanks <<him>> and leaves the easier task within reach.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾检查床铺，你整理干净的布巾。一名年幼见习教徒提出帮忙，罗宾道了谢，把较轻松的活留给<<him>>。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      When the list is finished, Robin brings it to Jordan in <<his>> own hand.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      清单做完后，罗宾亲手把它交给约旦。
  <</language>>
  <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 3)>>
  <<grace 1>><br><br><<ggrace>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Today’s work is already finished.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Penance
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.penance_day gte 0 and Time.days gte $RobinTemple.penance_day and $RobinTemple.penance_service gte 3
  and $player.virginity.temple is true>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.penance_day to -1>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.breach isnot 'pc'>><<set C.npc.Robin.virginity.temple to true>><</if>>
  <<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').restorePromise()>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.breach to ''>>
  <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 5)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin finishes the last shift and brings Jordan the completed list. Jordan accepts it, then renews <<his>> temple vow. Robin folds the list with care before taking your hand.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾结束最后一班工作，把填完的清单交给约旦。约旦收下清单，重新接纳<<his>>的神殿誓言。罗宾仔细折好清单，才牵住你的手。
  <</language>>
  <br><br><<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="green">Robin's temple vow is restored.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="green">罗宾重新立下了神殿誓言。</span>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Complete work with Robin on three different days, wait until the seventh day, and renew your own temple vow before returning.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      至少在三个不同的日子与罗宾一起做事，等到第七天，并先恢复你自己的神殿誓言，再回来交还记录。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon "quarters">><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>
